"gain":{c:"The theory ---- ground slowly at first, but once the fossil evidence was published it became the standard explanation in a single generation.",b:"gained",f:"past",tr:"Kuram basta yavas yavas zemin kazandi; ancak fosil kanitlari yayimlandiginda tek bir kusak icinde standart aciklamaya donustu."},
