"limit":{c:"Endurance athletes push the body to its ----, which is why sudden cardiac failure, though rare, occurs more often in marathons than in shorter races.",b:"limit",f:"",tr:"Dayaniklilik sporculari bedeni sinirina kadar zorlar; ani kalp yetmezliginin nadir olsa da maratonlarda kisa mesafe yarislarina gore daha sik gorulmesinin nedeni budur."},
